{"seq":25,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-05-vantorre-tickets/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:34:13.119Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"70ba393c864fae92805b56df307d3c224912cded13246c9696104ab0a8212dfc","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Nadia, I found four tickets on Vantorre Group (the parent), plus one that is probably yours but isn't named in its source. I read #strategic-pod, #inc-vtg-hartford and every Moss Strategic digest.\n\n**Tickets on Vantorre Group**\n1. **#8841** (also written #PD-8841) is a gate kiosk problem at Vantorre's plants.\n   - **4/27 digest:** it appears as #PD-8841, two missed carrier check-ins at Allentown, Gate 4, 2nd shift.\n   - **5/4 digest:** it is listed as open, a kiosk timeout at Allentown, Dock Door 12, 2nd shift.\n   - **9/30 digest:** it is listed as submitted by Mateo, Dock Door 14 can't be selected on the kiosk, Newark, escalated to platform engineering.\n   - **#strategic-pod, 7/1 (Gideon):** he says he closed it.\n   - The sources disagree on the site, the door and whether it is open or closed. I'd confirm its status and details before the steering committee.\n2. **INC-4821** is the Hartford kiosk outage and Mateo's status-page access issue. The source is #inc-vtg-hartford, Gideon, 8/3, 11:08. He says a screenshot is attached to it.\n3. **VT-55120** is the root-cause ticket for the Hartford kiosk outage. The source is #inc-vtg-hartford, Gideon, 10/14. He says Carrowmere's gateway finding and the reconnect log are attached.\n4. **#PD-4418** is a `Carrier_Dwell_Summary` export dropping Dock Door 9 timestamps at the 04:00 shift change. The source is the 9/15/2025 digest. That digest only says \"the account Nadia runs\" and never names Vantorre. The 5/3 digest and the cheat sheet identify Vantorre Group as Nadia's account, but that is inference, so please verify.\n\n**Left out on purpose**\n- **#4812** is Vantorre Mobility (3/10/2025 digest).\n- **#PD-4402** is Quillfeather (9/15/2025 digest).\n- **#8836** is a trailer number, not a ticket.\n\n**Sources with no Vantorre Group tickets:** the 7/7/2025, 12/1/2025, 5/3/2026 and 8/3/2026 digests, the cheat sheet, and the rest of #strategic-pod. The 8/3 digest and 5/3 digest mention duplicate arrival entries and a Hartford disruption but give no ticket number.\n\nTickets that were never posted in these three places won't appear here. The brain's search was keyword-only, so I read the channels and digests directly to cover it."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
